{"type": "chunks", "title": "Topic 12 · The Importance of Self-Esteem · Chunks", "source": "Modern Wisdom · Chris Williamson & Naval Ravikant · youtu.be/KyfUysrNaco", "audio": "audio/ch_t12/all.mp3", "items": [{"n": 1, "c": "not having self-esteem", "zh": "没有自尊", "s": "The worst outcome in the world is not having self-esteem.", "sp": "Chris", "hl": [34, 56], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o00.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q00.mp3", "src": [1263.85, 1265.05], "t": 0.0, "m": [["o", 0.0], ["o", 1.88], ["o", 3.76], ["z", 5.64], ["o", 7.45], ["o", 9.33], ["o", 11.21]], "sg": [[0, 57, "audio/t12o/s01.mp3", 0, 2.13]]}, {"n": 2, "c": "a tough one", "zh": "一个难题", "s": "It’s a tough one.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [5, 16], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o01.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q01.mp3", "src": [1267.6, 1268.44], "t": 13.43, "m": [["o", 13.43], ["o", 14.96], ["o", 16.48], ["z", 18.0], ["o", 19.86], ["o", 21.39], ["o", 22.91]], "sg": [[0, 17, "audio/t12o/s03.mp3", 0, 0.95]]}, {"n": 3, "c": "wrestling with themselves", "zh": "和自己较劲", "s": "I look at the people who don’t like themselves and that’s the toughest slot because they’re always wrestling with themselves.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [99, 124], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o02.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q02.mp3", "src": [1279.8, 1280.86], "t": 24.76, "m": [["o", 24.76], ["o", 26.53], ["o", 28.28], ["z", 30.05], ["o", 32.07], ["o", 33.83], ["o", 35.59]], "sg": [[0, 30, "audio/t12o/s04.mp3", 0, 1.46], [31, 61, "audio/t12o/s04.mp3", 1.46, 3.74], [62, 125, "audio/t12o/s04.mp3", 3.74, 6.43]]}, {"n": 4, "c": "an insurmountable challenge", "zh": "无法克服的挑战", "s": "It’s hard enough to face the outside world, and no one’s going to like you more than you like yourself, so if you’re struggling with yourself then the outside world becomes an insurmountable challenge.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [173, 200], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o03.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q03.mp3", "src": [1289.36, 1290.82], "t": 37.57, "m": [["o", 37.57], ["o", 39.71], ["o", 41.85], ["z", 44.0], ["o", 46.28], ["o", 48.42], ["o", 50.56]], "sg": [[0, 43, "audio/t12o/s05.mp3", 0, 1.94], [44, 103, "audio/t12o/s05.mp3", 2.54, 4.76], [104, 141, "audio/t12o/s05.mp3", 5.08, 6.92], [142, 201, "audio/t12o/s05.mp3", 6.98, 9.65]]}, {"n": 5, "c": "it might just be circumstantial", "zh": "也可能只是环境造成的", "s": "It might be genetic, it might just be circumstantial.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [21, 52], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o04.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q04.mp3", "src": [1295.2, 1297.02], "t": 53.02, "m": [["o", 53.02], ["o", 55.52], ["o", 58.02], ["z", 60.52], ["o", 63.36], ["o", 65.86], ["o", 68.36]], "sg": [[0, 20, "audio/t12o/s07.mp3", 0, 0.88], [21, 53, "audio/t12o/s07.mp3", 0.98, 2.79]]}, {"n": 6, "c": "unconditionally loved as a child", "zh": "小时候被无条件地爱着", "s": "A lot of times I think it’s because they just weren’t unconditionally loved as a child and that sort of seeps in at a deep core level, but self-esteem issues can be the most limiting.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [54, 86], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o05.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q05.mp3", "src": [1298.76, 1300.4], "t": 71.17, "m": [["o", 71.17], ["o", 73.5], ["o", 75.83], ["z", 78.17], ["o", 81.1], ["o", 83.43], ["o", 85.76]], "sg": [[0, 53, "audio/t12o/s08.mp3", 0, 1.7], [54, 86, "audio/t12o/s08.mp3", 1.7, 3.18], [87, 134, "audio/t12o/s08.mp3", 3.52, 6.18], [135, 183, "audio/t12o/s08.mp3", 7.34, 9.91]]}, {"n": 7, "c": "to some extent", "zh": "在某种程度上", "s": "One interesting thought is that to some extent self-esteem is a reputation you have with yourself.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [32, 46], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o06.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q06.mp3", "src": [1310.68, 1311.72], "t": 88.33, "m": [["o", 88.33], ["o", 90.06], ["o", 91.8], ["z", 93.55], ["o", 95.66], ["o", 97.39], ["o", 99.14]], "sg": [[0, 31, "audio/t12o/s09.mp3", 0, 2.5], [32, 58, "audio/t12o/s09.mp3", 3.12, 3.94], [59, 98, "audio/t12o/s09.mp3", 4.52, 6.47]]}, {"n": 8, "c": "a reputation you have with yourself", "zh": "你在自己心中的名声", "s": "One interesting thought is that to some extent self-esteem is a reputation you have with yourself.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [62, 97], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o07.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q07.mp3", "src": [1312.44, 1314.1], "t": 101.11, "m": [["o", 101.11], ["o", 103.48], ["o", 105.83], ["z", 108.19], ["o", 110.74], ["o", 113.09], ["o", 115.45]], "sg": [[0, 31, "audio/t12o/s09.mp3", 0, 2.5], [32, 58, "audio/t12o/s09.mp3", 3.12, 3.94], [59, 98, "audio/t12o/s09.mp3", 4.52, 6.47]]}, {"n": 9, "c": "your own moral code", "zh": "你自己的道德准则", "s": "You’re watching yourself at all times, you know what you’re doing and you have your own moral code.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [79, 98], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o08.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q08.mp3", "src": [1318.1, 1318.97], "t": 118.02, "m": [["o", 118.02], ["o", 119.59], ["o", 121.16], ["z", 122.73], ["o", 125.16], ["o", 126.73], ["o", 128.31]], "sg": [[0, 38, "audio/t12o/s10.mp3", 0, 1.9], [39, 99, "audio/t12o/s10.mp3", 1.94, 4.15]]}, {"n": 10, "c": "very far and few between", "zh": "少之又少", "s": "If I look back on my life and what are the moments that I’m actually proud of, they’re very far and few between.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [87, 111], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o09.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q09.mp3", "src": [1344.16, 1345.2], "t": 130.11, "m": [["o", 130.11], ["o", 131.85], ["o", 133.58], ["z", 135.33], ["o", 137.2], ["o", 138.94], ["o", 140.69]], "sg": [[0, 29, "audio/t12o/s14.mp3", 0, 2.88], [30, 86, "audio/t12o/s14.mp3", 3.52, 5.4], [87, 112, "audio/t12o/s14.mp3", 5.62, 6.81]]}, {"n": 11, "c": "I made a sacrifice", "zh": "我做出了牺牲", "s": "It’s when I made a sacrifice for somebody or something that I loved.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [10, 28], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o10.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q10.mp3", "src": [1351.84, 1352.95], "t": 142.66, "m": [["o", 142.66], ["o", 144.46], ["o", 146.28], ["z", 148.09], ["o", 150.14], ["o", 151.94], ["o", 153.75]], "sg": [[0, 11, "audio/t12o/s16.mp3", 0, 0.86], [12, 68, "audio/t12o/s16.mp3", 0.86, 3.87]]}, {"n": 12, "c": "at some level", "zh": "在某种层面上", "s": "Now that’s through an explicit mental exercise, but I’ll bet you at some level I’m recording that implicitly.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [65, 78], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o11.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q11.mp3", "src": [1361.02, 1361.69], "t": 155.8, "m": [["o", 155.8], ["o", 157.16], ["o", 158.52], ["z", 159.87], ["o", 162.04], ["o", 163.4], ["o", 164.75]], "sg": [[0, 47, "audio/t12o/s18.mp3", 0, 2.02], [48, 109, "audio/t12o/s18.mp3", 2.1, 4.57]]}, {"n": 13, "c": "the way to create love is to give love", "zh": "创造爱的方式就是给予爱", "s": "So that tells me that even if I am not being loved, the way to create love is to give love, to express love through sacrifice and through duty.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [52, 90], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o12.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q12.mp3", "src": [1366.2, 1368.44], "t": 166.42, "m": [["o", 166.42], ["o", 169.34], ["o", 172.27], ["z", 175.21], ["o", 178.22], ["o", 181.16], ["o", 184.09]], "sg": [[0, 51, "audio/t12o/s19.mp3", 0, 2.76], [52, 91, "audio/t12o/s19.mp3", 2.8, 4.98], [92, 143, "audio/t12o/s19.mp3", 5.08, 7.79]]}, {"n": 14, "c": "as opposed to", "zh": "而不是", "s": "It’s like, yeah, but that was you sacrificing something that you wanted less for something that you wanted more, as opposed to genuinely taking some sort of cost.", "sp": "Chris", "hl": [113, 126], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o13.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q13.mp3", "src": [1385.52, 1386.33], "t": 187.25, "m": [["o", 187.25], ["o", 188.75], ["o", 190.25], ["z", 191.75], ["o", 193.34], ["o", 194.85], ["o", 196.35]], "sg": [[0, 16, "audio/t12o/s22.mp3", 0, 1.41], [17, 60, "audio/t12o/s22.mp3", 1.41, 3.22], [61, 112, "audio/t12o/s22.mp3", 3.22, 5.48], [113, 162, "audio/t12o/s22.mp3", 5.7, 8.31]]}, {"n": 15, "c": "some sort of cost", "zh": "某种代价", "s": "It’s like, yeah, but that was you sacrificing something that you wanted less for something that you wanted more, as opposed to genuinely taking some sort of cost.", "sp": "Chris", "hl": [144, 161], "o": "audio/ch_t12/o14.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t12/q14.mp3", "src": [1387.0